From: Principal Engineer <review@prod.harden>
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] CRITICAL: LLM singleton + dependency injection

Creating a new ChatOpenAI on every node call wastes memory and
re-parses config. Use a module-level singleton with lazy init.

--- langgraph/state_machine.py
+++ langgraph/state_machine.py
@@ -35,15 +35,41 @@
